# autoDQM training-fraction scan — apply+combine rerun at z_threshold=7.0.
# Models were already trained (and their saved detector.pkl z_threshold patched
# in place) so this DAG skips the train node entirely and starts at apply.
JOB   apply    condor/submit_scan_apply.sub
JOB   combine  condor/submit_scan_combine.sub

PARENT apply  CHILD combine
